# Shell scripts MUST keep LF line endings. On Windows, Claude Code runs the statusline & hooks
# through Git Bash; a CRLF (\r) in the shebang or any command line makes bash fail with cryptic
# "\r: command not found" / "bad interpreter" errors. Force LF on checkout everywhere, on every OS.
*.sh    text eol=lf
*.json  text eol=lf
*.md    text eol=lf
*.example.sh text eol=lf
